    {
      "id": "481fef29-a20f-4c1e-b368-a992ffd093ed",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        800,
        224
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 3,
        "width": 560,
        "height": 448,
        "content": "## Capture invoice request (Form Trigger)\n\nThis section shows a public invoice request form and captures all user inputs in a single form_data object. It keeps raw form values together so later nodes can easily read fields like form_data.fullName, form_data.email, and form_data.invoice_no without re‑mapping."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "cd450bcb-1d32-4e21-a885-52f5f37179a1",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1408,
        224
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 3,
        "width": 640,
        "height": 448,
        "content": "## Validate data and prepare invoice metadata\nThis section validates that key fields (customer name, email, invoice number) are present. If valid, it builds a static items array, generates a unique document_id, and assembles everything into a clean payload with form_data, items, and outputFileName ready for the PDF template engine."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "8efda0ea-9601-4e51-a208-d25a2ee18a1d",
      "name": "Sticky Note2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        2096,
        224
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 3,
        "width": 560,
        "height": 448,
        "content": "## Generate invoice PDF\n\nThis section sends the prepared payload to APITemplate.io using your invoice template ID. The node replaces template placeholders with actual values and returns a PDF plus download URL. An IF node checks that binary data exists, confirming successful generation before moving to storage and notifications.\n\n"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "65191084-1597-4f6b-b2cc-f550eba79890",
      "name": "Sticky Note3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        2704,
        224
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 3,
        "width": 832,
        "height": 448,
        "content": "## Store file and notify customer & team\n\nThis section uploads the generated PDF to a dedicated Google Drive folder using a clear invoice file name, then emails the customer with the invoice attached plus Drive and direct download links. It also posts a formatted Slack message summarizing invoice details and sharing both links so the internal team can quickly review and open the invoice."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
